      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحاصّوا</span></b>  <i>They</i> (namely, creditors,) <i>divided
property among themselves in portions, lots,</i> or
<i>shares;</i> (S, * Mgh, Msb, K; *) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حاصّوا</span></b> ,
(K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحَاصَّةٌ</span> (S, TA) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِصَاصٌ</span>; (TA;)
<i>every one of them taking his portion.</i> (TA.)

